    "description": "Mahindra Rivenza by Mahindra Lifespaces is a ~13.46-acre gated community in Baner Annex \u2013 village Nande, off the Baner\u2013Hinjawadi Road, between Mahalunge and Hinjawadi, with the Mula river and hills alongside. The launch covers six high-rise towers (T1\u2013T6) with 1,236 homes in RERA-registered Phase 1 and Phase 2, and there are dedicated towers for 2, 3 and 4 BHK residences. Homes range from 2 BHK of 688\u2013855 sq ft and 3 BHK of 995\u20131,206 sq ft to 4 BHK of 1,615\u20131,650 sq ft (total area including balconies and utility). The plans include walk-in wardrobes in the 2 and 3 BHK homes, decks off the living rooms, and a butterfly 4 BHK layout with a servant room. Over 9 acres are landscaped greens, and more than 2.65 lakh sq ft is given to amenities \u2013 two clubhouses, a swimming pool with a sunken bar, futsal, pickleball, badminton and squash courts, a skating rink, a gym, yoga lawns and decks, a library, a barbeque deck and stargazing hammocks. The project is IGBC Gold pre-certified. Delhi Public School Hinjawadi is next door, Hinjawadi Phase 1 is about 6 km away and the Balewadi metro station (Line 3) about 5.7 km. Prices start from \u20b989 Lakh for a 2 BHK on a construction-linked plan, and RERA possession is December 2031. Enquire for the brochure, floor plans and EOI benefits.",
