    "description": "Avani Amara is a residential project by Avani Housing, developed with Bansall, in Keshav Nagar, Mundhwa, Pune, opposite the Godrej substation (Sr. No. 9 to 14/1/49). Spread over about 2 acres, it has five connected towers of ground plus 20 floors with 2 and 3 BHK homes that the developer calls Signature Homes. Wing A has 2 BHK homes of 800 to 802 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 1,054 to 1,055 sq ft, and Wing B has compact 2 BHK homes, with a bedroom and a study room, of 609 to 638 sq ft. These are total carpet areas, including the balcony. All-inclusive prices start at \u20b975 lakh for a 2 BHK and \u20b91.30 crore for a 3 BHK. More than 30 amenities are spread across landscaped zones and the rooftop: a clubhouse, swimming pool with deck, multipurpose sports court, open-air gym and fitness club, yoga and meditation zone, jogging track, climbing walls, children's and toddlers' play areas, a dog park, party lawn with buffet and barbecue areas, amphitheatre seating, a stargazing area, co-working hub, library and cr\u00e8che. Homes have 1600 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a branded biometric lock on the main door, UPVC sliding windows, AC points in the living room and every bedroom and 5 A generator backup, and the project adds rainwater harvesting, a sewage treatment plant, a heat pump for central hot water, solar lighting in common areas and provision for EV charging. Kharadi is about 4 km away, Hadapsar 5.3 km, Koregaon Park 6.5 km, Pune Station 9.5 km and Pune Airport 11 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA (PR1260002501370).",
