    "description": "Petals by Pashankar Developers is a residential project at Sr. No. 27/1, near Raghunandan Lawns, Nimbalkar Nagar, Tathawade, about 400 m from Dange Chowk and 100 m from the Aundh-Ravet BRTS road. Six wings, A to F, of basement, ground and seven floors hold 147 homes in five layouts: 1 BHK of 438 and 490 sq ft, 2 BHK of 679 and 806 sq ft and 3 BHK of 963 sq ft. The 1 BHK of 490 sq ft is offered at \u20b959.49 lakh with an allotted car park and the 2 BHK of 806 sq ft at \u20b991 lakh, both all inclusive. Rooftop terraces have landscaped gardens, open gym equipment and gazebo sit-outs, and the project has a Ganesh mandir, a children's play area and a senior citizens' area. Homes get a main door with an automated electronic lock with fingerprint access, 1600 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a black granite kitchen platform with a stainless steel sink, powder-coated aluminium sliding windows with mosquito nets, Jaquar or equivalent fittings with hot and cold mixers, concealed copper wiring with Legrand or equivalent switches and AC provision in the master bedroom. The building has 24-hour CCTV and security, a designer entrance gate with a security cabin, a lift with generator backup, solar water heating, a sewage treatment plant and a multi video door phone system. Ravet is about 5 minutes away, the Mumbai-Pune highway about 6, JSPM College of Engineering about 7, Aditya Birla Memorial Hospital about 10, Phoenix Marketcity Wakad about 11 and Hinjewadi IT Park about 15 to 17 minutes. The developer gives completion as February 2027, and the project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100051579.",
