    "description": "18 Aangan is a gated enclave of just 18 independent 3 BHK row houses by Four Pillars in Maan, off Maan Road near Hinjewadi Phase 1 and the Rajiv Gandhi Infotech Park, with Rising Spaces as strategic partner. Each row house has its own entrance, a private car porch, front and rear gardens (side gardens on the end units) and three levels: the living and dining room, kitchen, utility and a bedroom on the ground floor, two bedrooms and a balcony on the first floor, and open terraces on the terrace floor, under a glass-topped staircase that brings daylight into the home. Homes have about 1,110 to 1,263 sq ft of RERA carpet area including balconies (about 1,190 sq ft for the typical units 2 to 11), and about 2,070 to 2,470 sq ft of net sale area including the share of gardens, terrace and parking; prices start at \u20b91.89 crore. The houses are Vastu-conscious, with no one living above or below, and each has its own solar panels and EV charging point. The enclave is laid out along 30-foot internal concrete roads behind a designer entrance gate, a 7-foot perimeter wall and 24/7 security, with a leisure swimming pool, an open pagoda, a lawn, a children's play area, a senior citizens' sit-out, indoor games, a temple, walkways, DG backup, in-ground road lighting and roadside planting. From Maan Road, Infosys Circle in Phase 1 and the IT companies of Hinjewadi Phases 1, 2 and 3 are a short drive away, and the Mahalunge-Hinjawadi IT Park bridge leads across the Mula river to Mahalunge, Balewadi and Baner. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002501338 by the promoter Four Pillars.",
