    "description": "Skyone is a boutique residential project by Nawani Developers on Ravet Road in Walhekarwadi, Chinchwad, near Rajyog Petrol Pump, on a plot of about a quarter of an acre. Its two buildings now launching, B and C, have just 36 homes on six floors above basement and ground-floor parking, and every flat gets a covered car park. B building has four 2 BHK homes on each floor, of 800 and 817 sq ft, at \u20b985 lakh and \u20b987 lakh all-inclusive; C building has two 3 BHK homes on each floor, of 957 sq ft, at \u20b91 crore all-inclusive. Areas are the MahaRERA carpet area plus the open and dry balconies. Each 2 BHK has a living room of about 15'6\" x 10'6\" opening onto a 15'6\" x 6'7\" balcony, a kitchen with a utility area and a 13'6\" master bedroom, and the compact 3 BHK has a 16'1\" x 15'9\" living and dining room and a 16' x 5' balcony. Amenities include a jogging track, a children's play area, a meditation area, a landscaped garden and tree plantation, a designer entrance lobby, solar water, rainwater harvesting, a grey water treatment plant, a video door phone and power backup for the lift, pumps and common areas. Homes have an earthquake-resistant RCC frame with AAC block walls, 800 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a granite kitchen platform, Jaguar or equivalent fittings and Polycab or RR cables. The developer places Chinchwad railway station, the Aundh-Ravet BRTS road, the Mumbai-Pune Expressway, schools, colleges, hospitals and D-Mart within 5 to 10 minutes. Skyone is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601495, with possession in December 2027.",
