    "description": "Sukhwani Gemzs is a low-density residential project by Prime Properties, a Sukhwani Group company, on Thakar Nagar Road in Maan, near Hinjewadi. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601952. The 4,250 sq m (about 1.05 acre) parcel holds the homes and a separate amenity parcel, with about 4,500 sq ft of open space for amenities, parking on three levels (basement, ground and podium) and no MHADA component. It offers Vaastu-compliant 2 BHK homes of 730 sq ft, 2.5 BHK homes of 860 sq ft with a flex room, and 3 BHK homes of 923 sq ft (RERA carpet plus balconies), at all-inclusive prices of \u20b91.03 crore, \u20b91.21 crore and \u20b91.30 crore. The all-inclusive price covers GST, stamp duty, registration, the corpus fund, two years' maintenance, legal and society charges and parking. Amenities include a clubhouse, a gym, a multipurpose court, a children's play area, sitout zones, walking paths and landscaped open space. Homes get 600 x 1200 mm vitrified tiles, a digital main-door lock and video door phone, a separate dry balcony with a sink, a granite kitchen platform and inverter provision. The brochure puts MIS School 1.1 km away, Elpro International School 2.6 km, Ruby Hall Clinic Hinjawadi 3.7 km, Grand Highstreet 4.4 km and the Wipro, TCS and Infosys campuses 5.2 to 6.4 km away. Possession is planned for June 2030.",
