    "description": "Pristine Amore is a luxury residential project by Pristine Properties on Late Sopanrao Trimbakrao Mulik Road in Kalyani Nagar, opposite Cerebrum IT Park. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1261012600653, with Pristine Landmark Spaces LLP as the promoter, and possession is planned for December 2030. Designed by UHA London, the 4.12-acre master layout shows about 300 homes in five wings: A and B with four homes a floor and C, D and E with two; the Wing B plan set marks Wings C and D as future development. The wings rise to 24 floors above three basements, ceilings are 3.35 m high and there is no MHADA component. Wing B offers 3 BHK homes of 1,659 and 1,681 sq ft, 4.5 BHK homes (four bedrooms and a servant room) of 1,975 and 2,003 sq ft, 3,247 sq ft 5 BHK homes on the refuge floors, and duplexes on the 22nd and 23rd floors: 4 BHK of 2,720 to 2,746 sq ft and 5 BHK of 3,472 to 3,485 sq ft. Sizes are RERA carpet plus balconies, and quoted prices start at \u20b94.25 crore. Amenities sit on three levels: a rooftop infinity pool, spa, salon and screening room on the terrace; a podium lawn, gym, Pilates and dance studios, library and cr\u00e8che on the third floor; and, on the second floor, an emergency room, consultation room, pharmacy and physiotherapy centre backed by 24x7 nursing and ambulance service. A high street of showrooms and shops sits at the base.",
