    "description": "Pristine Amore Highstreet is the retail podium of Pristine Amore, a Pristine Properties project on Late Sopanrao Trimbakrao Mulik Road in Kalyani Nagar, opposite Cerebrum IT Park. It fronts the 18 m Cerebrum Road and an 18 m driveway, shares the homes' MahaRERA registration (PR1261012600653) and has the same December 2030 possession date. The ground floor holds showrooms 1 to 24, each with a mezzanine; the current price list offers ten of them, from 1,315 to 4,005 sq ft (ground-floor carpet plus mezzanine), at \u20b96.64 crore to \u20b923.56 crore. Shops 28 to 51 sit on the level above the mezzanines (the price list calls it the first floor, the drawings the 2nd floor), and the list offers eleven sizes from 944 to 3,260 sq ft at \u20b94.75 crore to \u20b913.67 crore. The brochure pitches the spaces at restaurants, fashion, jewellery and automotive brands, and at larger stores or offices, with high-street visibility across several levels. Above the shops are about 300 homes in five wings designed by UHA London, with their own healthcare floor, podium lawn and rooftop amenities, so the high street has a resident catchment on site. The brochure's location map also shows Cerebrum IT Park, DMart, Kopa Mall, Brahma Suncity, Cybage and the Kalyani Nagar and Ramwadi metro stations nearby.",
