    "description": "Codename Vybe, also called the Luxury Riverine Collection, is a pre-launch residential project at Anand Nagar on Sinhagad Road, marketed by Ranawat Group with Welworth Realty. It has no MahaRERA registration number yet, and the developer has not published prices, a possession date, the land area or the number of towers; until it is registered, it cannot legally be booked or sold. Plans released so far cover A Building, floors 1 to 11: five 3 BHK layouts of 1,121, 1,198, 1,215, 1,244 and 1,285 sq ft of carpet and a 1,746 sq ft 4 BHK, 53 homes in all. Each typical floor has five homes around one lift lobby with four lifts, one of them a fire lift; the 2nd and 7th are refuge floors, each with one 4 BHK. Every home has a dry balcony off the kitchen and a pooja space, each 3 BHK has three toilets, and up to three bedrooms get walk-in wardrobes. The presentation promises more than 20 amenities and names an infinity-edge pool, a main pool, a clubhouse, a fitness centre, a temple, net cricket, rooftop amenities and a jogging track. Specifications include vitrified flooring, a modular kitchen with a chimney and piped gas, aluminium sliding windows, a digital main-door lock, USB-C points in bedrooms and 2 kV DG backup per flat. Room sizes come from working drawings and may change.",
