    "description": "Mangalam Momento is a two-tower residential project by Mangalam Landmarks on the Pune\u2013Nashik Highway in Moshi, beside Moshi Fire Station and near Bharat Mata Chowk. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601445, with Preetam Prakash Associates as the promoter, and possession is planned for December 2031. Wings A and B rise to the 29th floor, with ten homes a floor in Wing A and twelve in Wing B, and are built with aluminium formwork. Homes are 2 BHK of 748, 799 and 911 sq ft, 2.5 BHK of 931 sq ft and 3 BHK of 996, 1,016 and 1,041 sq ft, each the carpet area plus dry and open balconies. Prices start at \u20b969.50 lakh for the 748 sq ft 2 BHK, about \u20b99,300 per sq ft. Amenities are grouped into zones: a pool with a kids' pool and deck, a pickleball court and a multipurpose half court, a party lawn with a stage and amphitheatre seating, a children's play area, a senior citizens' court, a temple and an oxygen park, a yoga and meditation lawn, an exercise yard and a multipurpose hall. Homes get 600 x 1200 mm tiles, wooden-finish flooring in the master bedroom, Jaquar fittings and a video door phone. The brochure puts Bliss Hospital and a Reliance mall 1 km away, Talawade IT Park and Bhosari MIDC 7 km and Pune airport 17 km.",
