    "description": "Serenopolis is a single 14-storey tower of 121 homes by Nirman Greens in Nirman District, Tathawade, where it joins the developer's Astropolis and Cosmopolis. It stands on Link Road in Ashok Nagar, next to Sharayu Toyota, with commercial spaces at its base, and is registered with MahaRERA as P52100080004, with completion proposed for April 2029. It offers 2 BHK homes of 757 and 779 sq ft from \u20b980.62 lakh and 3 BHK homes of 921 sq ft from \u20b997.75 lakh (base prices; about \u20b990.61 lakh and \u20b91.09 crore all inclusive). More than 35 amenities are spread over three levels: a jogging track and a reception lobby on the ground; a swimming pool, kids' pool, gym, indoor games area and yoga deck on the podium; and a party lawn, stage, open-air cinema, kids' and toddlers' play areas, a star-gazing deck and senior citizens' seating on the terrace. Homes get Italian-finish vitrified flooring, full-height bedroom windows, a modular kitchen with a chimney, a gas leak detector and sprinklers, AC in the master bedroom, AC points in every room and a digital main-door lock. By the brochure's drive times, Pulse Hospital, JSPM College and the Mumbai\u2013Bengaluru highway are 3 minutes away and a metro station and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium 10 minutes.",
