    "description": "City One Panache Commercial is the shop and office podium of City One Panache 2.0, a 26-storey tower in Sector 29 of the Pradhikaran area of Ravet, Pimpri-Chinchwad, registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002600510. The ground floor has 28 shops, numbered 1 to 29 (there is no shop 2), wrapped around a commercial parking court, with road frontage on three sides; the developer's price list groups them as main-road, EVM and garden facing. Shops 1 to 21 come with a mezzanine and shops 22 to 29 without one. Carpet areas run from 191 to 663 sq ft, and the price list of 27 September 2026 prices them from \u20b980.59 lakh (191 sq ft, garden facing) to \u20b95.02 crore (663 sq ft, main road). Two offices of 4,460 sq ft each face the main road at \u20b922.48 crore apiece. The ground floor plan keeps the residential entrance, lobby and lifts separate from the shops, with ramps to a basement and a parking level. The developer puts EuroKids preschool 2 minutes away, Ojas Multispeciality Hospital in Ravet 3 minutes, the Sant Tukaram Maharaj bridge 4 minutes, PCCOE and Akurdi railway station 5 minutes, Oxycare Superspeciality Hospital 6 minutes, Orchids The International School 10 minutes, and Aditya Birla Hospital and Lokmanya Hospital Chinchwad about 15 minutes away. Possession is planned for December 2028.",
