    "description": "Oriana World is a residential project by Balaji Builders in Ashok Nagar, Tathawade, Pune 411033, near Bhumkar Chowk Road. The development is planned as five towers of basement, ground, podium and 25 floors on roughly 5 acres; the first MahaRERA phase, Buildings D and E, covers two towers and 315 homes on 1.53 acres. Apartments listed under that phase are 2 BHK of about 734 to 929 sq ft carpet and 3 BHK of about 1,070 sq ft carpet. Prices differ between sources, so the site shows price on request; contact the Pune Home team for the current rate card. Amenities include a swimming pool, clubhouse, gymnasium, kids' play area, jogging track, multipurpose sports court, yoga lawn, landscaped garden, CCTV and power backup, with podium and basement parking. Listings place the Mumbai-Bengaluru Highway within about a kilometre, Vision One Mall about 2 km away and Chinchwad railway station roughly 7 to 8 km away. The project is registered with MahaRERA under P52100080096 with a proposed completion of 31 December 2028.",
