    "description": "VTP Codename Never Before West is an upcoming VTP Luxe project of duplex 'villas in the sky' in VTP's Township Codename Blue Waters at Mahalunge (Baner Next), West Pune, on the Mula riverfront beside Earth 1 by VTP Luxe. The tentative master plan shows four 36-storey towers with 18 lower and 18 upper villa levels and a landscaped riverside promenade. Homes come in four duplex types: Priv\u00e9 Villa and Priv\u00e9 Villa Max (3 BHK, about 1,835 and 2,044 sq ft carpet) and Aristo Villa and Aristo Villa Max (4 BHK with a servant room, about 2,453 and 2,531 sq ft). Every villa has a private lift, a double-height living room of about 21 ft, a puja area, marble flooring in the living and dining, a whirlpool bath in the master washroom and smart home controls. Each tower has a grand drop-off and a double-height entrance lobby, and every floor a double-height lift lobby. Amenities include a private clubhouse, swimming pool, steam and sauna, gym, putt-putt golf, box cricket, kids' play area, a multipurpose court, a tennis court, an open-air event lawn and generous parking for large cars. Residents also get township facilities such as high-street shopping, a school, sports academies and landscaped zones. Indicative prices start at about \u20b93.60 Cr. The project is in pre-launch: it is not yet registered with MahaRERA and no possession date has been announced.",
