    "description": "RA Urbania is a residential project in Ganesh Nagar, Ravet, Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune 412101, on Survey No. 148 near Shinde Vasti and Pipeline Road. It is developed by Croissance Buildcon, a Pune partnership firm. The project is a single tower of 2 parking levels, ground and 17 floors, with 8 flats per floor, on a plot of about 0.74 acre (2,999 sq m as filed with MahaRERA). Homes are 2 BHK with carpet areas of 742 and 772 sq ft and 3 BHK of about 993 sq ft. Listings quote about Rs 78 lakh all-inclusive for the 772 sq ft 2 BHK and about Rs 96.82 lakh for the 3 BHK, and the project is described as built and ready to move in. Amenities listed include a swimming pool, gymnasium, jogging track, garden, yoga deck, amphitheatre, library and 24x7 security with CCTV. Listings place S B Patil Public School about 0.8 km away, Venkatesh Hospital about 0.9 km, D-Mart about 2.5 km and Akurdi railway station about 3.4 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number P52100050429. Contact the Pune Home team for availability and a site visit.",
