    "description": "Akshara Mayfair by Garve Developers is a 2.25-acre residential development in the heart of Tathawade, behind G.G. International School and Hotel Raaga Imperio at Newale Wasti, close to the Aundh\u2013Ravet BRTS Road and the Mumbai\u2013Bengaluru Highway. Two towers, A and B, rise B1 + B2 + ground + 21 storeys with just eight homes per floor and about 350 residences in all \u2013 a boutique, mostly-3 BHK community \u2013 served by four passenger lifts and a dedicated fire/service lift in each tower. Homes are spacious 2 BHK of 773 sq ft, 3 BHK Classic of 942 sq ft and 3 BHK Premium of 1,200 sq ft carpet area; the 3 BHK Premium has walk-in wardrobes and a separate dining area. More than 40 lifestyle amenities are spread across about an acre in three zones: a Courtyard Retreat with a semi-covered canopy pool, kids' pool, community lawn, party deck, multiplay court, yoga pavilion and garden pavilions; a Leisure Retreat with a grand entrance lobby, multipurpose hall, indoor gym and business/conference room; and a rooftop Skyline Retreat with an open-air cinema, pickleball court, sky work pods, wellness deck, green gym, barbeque area, hammock and swing garden and a sunrise and star-gazing deck. The building adds smart water metering, solar integration and an IoT backbone. G.G. International School is within walking distance, with daily essentials, Wakad and Hinjewadi a short drive away. All-inclusive prices start from \u20b991 Lakh for a 2 BHK, \u20b91.12 Cr for a 3 BHK Classic and \u20b91.41 Cr for a 3 BHK Premium. Possession is planned for December 2029; MahaRERA registration is awaited.",
