    "description": "Majestique Evolvus by Majestique Landmarks is a 10-acre landmark development in Central Kharadi, near the Kharadi bypass and next to BNY Mellon, with the EON Free Zone and World Trade Center close by. Its towers rise G + 26 floors above five levels of car parking, over a retail high street planned to stretch more than a kilometre. The current release offers luxurious 3 BHK homes of 1,149 to 1,300 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 1,565 to 1,715 sq ft carpet area, with premium specifications \u2013 a modular kitchen by Asian Sleek in the 3 and 4 BHK homes, a dishwasher provision, piped gas, a separate drinking-water line and Kone or equivalent elevators. More than 70 lifestyle amenities are spread across the ground level, a central podium and a premier terrace: a ~27,000 sq ft clubhouse with a double-height banquet hall, theatre, co-working space, gym and CrossFit zone, library, female spa and kids' play areas; a swimming pool with a juice bar and restaurant; basketball, multipurpose and box-cricket courts and a skating rink; a temple, pet park and bonfire area; ~33,400 sq ft of gardens; and an open-to-sky terrace walkway and jogging track of about 850 m with yoga space, a gazebo with water body, a fine-dine area and a sky lounge under a night-sky glass ceiling. Viman Nagar, Kalyani Nagar and Koregaon Park are close by, with Amanora Mall, Seasons Mall and Phoenix Marketcity within easy reach. Prices start from \u20b91.84 Cr for a 3 BHK and \u20b92.65 Cr for a 4 BHK (plus floor rise). MahaRERA P52100054253 (Evolvus Phase I).",
