    "description": "Antalya Next is a residential project at Ram Nagar, Tathawade, Pune 411033, built on a 2.25-acre plot as two towers of ground plus 17 floors with podium parking. It is registered with MahaRERA under P52100066556 by Sanil Constructions LLP and marketed by Estofa Realty. Homes are 2 BHK (725 to 844 sq ft RERA carpet), 3 BHK (970 to 1,119 sq ft) and 4 BHK (1,293 sq ft), with dry balconies and a walk-in wardrobe. Listings show 2 BHK homes from about Rs 1.01 crore, so confirm current rates and charges with the sales team. Amenities include a swimming pool, clubhouse, gymnasium, yoga deck, children's play area, landscaped gardens, a machan gazebo and a sunset and stargazing deck. The developer lists Pulse Multispeciality Hospital about 1 km away, Podar International School 1.5 km, Phoenix Mall of the Millennium 2.6 km, EON IT Park 4.3 km and Hinjawadi IT Park 4.7 km. Possession is proposed by March 2028 as per the MahaRERA certificate.",
