    "description": "Velvet Villas by VTP Luxe is an exclusive gated enclave of just 43 independent villas on a 5-acre land parcel inside VTP Realty's 165+ acre Township Codename Pegasus in New Kharadi, Pune, near WTC and EON IT Park. About an acre is kept as open space. Each villa rises ground + 1 floor with a private top terrace, in three types: Type 1 and Type 2 three-bedroom villas of 2,164 and 2,725 sq ft carpet, and Type 3 five-bedroom villas of 3,670 sq ft carpet, each with its own landscaped front and back gardens and a servant's room. Interiors feature Italian marble flooring, grand double-height living and dining areas overlooking the front garden, and a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and a skylight above the jacuzzi. The enclave has a palm-lined entry boulevard, a clubhouse with multipurpose hall and indoor gym, a heated swimming pool and children's pool, a multi-sport court, outdoor gym, children's play area, barbeque zone, senior citizen plaza and a party lawn with stage, plus multi-tier security and access to township amenities. Holy Angels Convent School is next door, Phoenix Market City and Amanora Mall are about 10 km away and the airport about 11 km. Prices start from \u20b96.20 Cr. Agreement possession is December 2026. MahaRERA P52100031829 (Phase 1) and P52100047370 (Phase 2).",
