    "description": "Shaligram The Mile by Shaligram Group is a single landmark tower on the Aundh\u2013Ravet BRTS Road in Ravet \u2013 the first high-rise you see entering Pune from Mumbai. On a 1.75-acre plot, it rises B2 + B1 + G + 36 floors with only 202 signature residences: 3 BHK homes of 1,124 to 1,301 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 1,465 and 1,560 sq ft carpet area. Homes have a 10.5 ft floor-to-floor height, full-height glass fa\u00e7ades, walk-in wardrobes, private sky decks and Vaastu-compliant layouts. Amenities are spread over three levels: a ground realm with gardens, gazebos, a jogging track, an amphitheatre, a kids' play area and a multipurpose banquet hall; an indulgence level with a swimming pool and deck, baby pool, jacuzzi, gym, cr\u00e8che and indoor games lounge; and a rooftop sky experience with a caf\u00e9, mini theatre, library and co-working area, yoga and meditation deck, sky walkway and stargazing deck. Ojas Multispecialty Hospital is about 2 minutes away, Global Hospital about 4 minutes, and Elpro City Square, Phoenix Mall of the Millennium and D-Mart Ravet about 10 minutes away. Launch prices start from \u20b91.38 Cr for a 3 BHK and \u20b91.80 Cr for a 4 BHK. MahaRERA PR1260002601415; RERA completion date December 2031.",
