    "description": "Prime Pinnacle is a Grade A commercial tower by Viraj Corp on Datta Mandir Road in Wakad, Pune 411057, which the developer describes as the tallest commercial building in Wakad. The project is a single 15-storey tower offering boutique offices with glass partitions and doors, a grand double-height entrance lobby, high-speed elevators, a washroom in every unit and a rooftop cafeteria. Smart offices have a carpet area of 346 to 752 sq ft, while premium offices range from 1,277 to 2,489 sq ft, and each unit gets its own three-phase meter with 24x7 DG backup. Parking is handled through a multi-level robotic car parking system, and the building has 24x7 security with an intercom facility, a fire hydrant system and two common conference rooms. Asking prices on property portals in October 2026 start at \u20b968 L for a Smart Office and \u20b92.23 Cr for a Premium Office; confirm the current price sheet with the sales team. According to the developer, Wakad Metro Station is about 5 minutes away, Hinjewadi 8 minutes, Balewadi 10 minutes and Cognizant H2 11 minutes. The project is registered under MahaRERA number P52100077826, with possession reported for September 2027.",
