    "description": "Unique Youtopia is a residential township in Central Kharadi, Pune, by Unique Properties in association with the Kodre family, on River Road. Phase IV, registered with MahaRERA as P52100080485, brings the A7 and A8 wings with 2 BHK homes of 748 to 761 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 893 to 1,009 sq ft (total area including balconies). Prices start at about \u20b91.01 crore for a 2 BHK and \u20b91.22 crore for a 3 BHK, including one covered parking. The project spreads 45+ amenities over 5 recreation zones and more than 40,000 sq ft of open area: an infinity pool and clubhouse, indoor gym with AC, spa and steam room, party hall, badminton, table tennis and multipurpose courts, a cricket net, jogging and barefoot tracks, yoga cove, children's play areas, a cr\u00e8che, Wi-Fi workstations and a theatre area. Homes have 600 mm x 1200 mm vitrified flooring, smart biometric locks, video door phones and solar-heated water in all bathrooms. Zensar IT Park and World Trade Center are about 2 km away, EON IT Park 3 km, and Pune airport about 9 km. The RERA completion date for Phase IV is April 2029.",
