    "description": "Godrej Ivara by Godrej Properties is a large-format community in Kharadi, Pune, a few minutes from EON Free Zone and the World Trade Center. Spread over about 12.8 acres with 11 towers (A to K), it offers 2, 3 and 4 BHK homes from 729 to 1,580 sq ft, with around 6 acres of open, landscaped greens. Amenities cover about 1 lakh sq ft across two clubhouses and a landscaped podium: a 10,000 sq ft gym with CrossFit and strength zones beside a yoga and wellness spa with a temperature-controlled jacuzzi, a 20,000 sq ft co-working space with quiet pods, meeting \"war rooms\", hot desks and private enterprise suites, a 10,000 sq ft Mediterranean-themed caf\u00e9 with indoor and alfresco dining, two banquet halls, indoor badminton and squash courts, a library, a cr\u00e8che, a wellness and spa area, a lagoon-style lap pool with jacuzzi and kids' pool, a floating deck with water features, an amphitheatre, multi-play, pickleball, half-basketball and box-cricket courts, a skate park, a pet park and an oval sports ground. Homes come with Kohler or equivalent sanitaryware, vitrified flooring, granite kitchen counters, sliding windows with mosquito mesh, a video door phone and solar water heating in the master bathroom, built to Godrej's quality standards (IS 1786 and IS 13920 steel, M35 concrete and 1.5 m waterproofing in wet areas). EON Free Zone and the World Trade Center are about 0.5 km away, Commerzone about 1.4 km, Viman Nagar 8\u201312 minutes and Pune International Airport about 20 minutes. Prices start from \u20b91.29 Cr for a 2 BHK (PLC and floor rise extra). MahaRERA PR1260002502426; RERA completion date December 2032.",
