    "description": "VJ Palladio La Viento is a residential project by Vilas Javdekar Developers at Baner-Mahalunge, near VIBGYOR High School, Pune. Spread over about 3.78 acres with roughly 75% open area, it has two 27-storey towers with 194 apartments. Homes come in 2, 3 and 4 BHK layouts with carpet areas from about 708 sq ft (2 BHK) to 1,086 sq ft (4 BHK), with listed prices starting around Rs 99 lakh; please confirm current pricing with the sales team. The towers are planned for cross-ventilation and carry a curved facade. A three-storey, Spanish-villa style Club LaViento anchors over 40 amenities across six landscaped zones, including a swimming pool with kids' pool, jogging track, multipurpose court, open gym, amphitheatre-style seating and a pets' area. The site lies between Baner, Sus and Balewadi, about 2.2 km from D-Mart and 2.3 km from the Sus-Pashan bridge, with the Mumbai-Pune bypass flyover about 3.6 km away. It is registered with MahaRERA under PR1260002501182, with a registered completion date of December 2029.",
